      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(ui): keep sidebar session order stable",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where users opening a chat session from the Control UI sidebar would see that session move to the top of the sidebar, making the list feel unstable during normal session switching.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThis draft keeps sidebar session selection separate from sidebar ordering, adds a compact sort control with Created and Last updated modes, closes the sort menu on outside click/Escape, and keeps the active row label at the same weight as inactive rows.\n\n`GatewaySessionRow` does not currently expose `createdAt`, so Created uses the first stable order observed from `sessions.list` in the sidebar. A future API-level `createdAt` field would let this become true creation-time sorting instead of a stable existing-order proxy.\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers can switch sessions without losing their place in the sidebar, and can explicitly switch the sidebar list to last-updated ordering when they want activity-first navigation.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `pnpm ui:i18n:check`\n- `pnpm exec oxfmt --check --threads=1 ui/src/components/app-sidebar.ts ui/src/components/icons.ts ui/src/styles/layout.css ui/src/i18n/locales/en.ts ui/src/e2e/chat-flow.e2e.test.ts`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `OPENCLAW_VITEST_NO_OUTPUT_TIMEOUT_MS=180000 node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run --config test/vitest/vitest.ui-e2e.config.ts --configLoader runner ui/src/e2e/chat-flow.e2e.test.ts -t \"keeps sidebar session order stable while selecting sessions and supports sort modes\"`\n\nPreflight note: the local public PR preflight script reported a large diff because this machine's local `main` branch is checked out in another worktree and is 105 commits behind `origin/main`. The PR diff was verified against `origin/main...HEAD`, which contains only the sidebar/session sort changes and generated Control UI i18n updates.\n",
